## Operational links

Audit-derived actions are stored in `research_program/action_register.csv` with IDs such as `R-AUDIT-*`. Source-article verification and bridge actions are linked separately through `A001`, `A002`, and cross-article IDs.

## Revision rule

Before a major restructuring:

1. read all registered audit files;
2. query open audit and cross-source actions;
3. verify incorporation against the current manuscript;
4. preserve any superseded wording only in traceability records, not manuscript prose;
5. update this index if a new audit is received.
